{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "d923ba69-ceb7-8d23-b802-978348de8f78",
  "created_at": "2026-02-20T09:34:38-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Zoning and Inspections",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Nilza Monteiro",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Greg Lombardi",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-20T09:32:56-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Zoning and Inspections, this is Greg."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-20T09:32:59-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi. Yes. I am opening a shop, and I want to put a sign over the new door. I do not understand if I need a permit for that."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-20T09:33:08-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, a sign usually does need a permit. Is it attached to the building or freestanding?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-20T09:33:14-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It is over the door. On the front of the building. Is that a sign permit or a building permit? The form online says both things. I am not sure which one I pick."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-20T09:33:25-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "For a sign over the door, you want the sign permit. Building permit is for construction work. If you're doing both, you might end up with two."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-20T09:33:34-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Two. Okay. I do not know if I am doing both. The sign is just going to be mounted with screws. The shop is at 404 Bellevue Avenue."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-20T09:33:43-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, Bellevue Avenue. Mounting with screws, that's probably just the sign permit. Bring a drawing with the size and where it goes, and the wording."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-20T09:33:51-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "A drawing. Of the sign, or of the door? I thought the picture of the door was the drawing."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-20T09:33:58-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Both is best. The sign with measurements, and a photo or sketch of the front showing where it hangs."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-20T09:34:04-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. How long does approval take? I have the sign being made already."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-20T09:34:09-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Depends how complete the application is. Could be a week or two. Don't hang it before you have the approval, though."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-20T09:34:16-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "A week or two. Okay. I will not hang it. Can you give me your last name? I would like to write down who I talked to, and spell it for me."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-20T09:34:26-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure. Lombardi. L-O-M-B-A-R-D-I."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-20T09:34:28-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "L-O-M-B-A-R-D-I. Thank you. I think I understand now. Mostly. Sign permit, drawing of the sign and the door."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-20T09:34:34-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's it. Call back if you get stuck on the form."
    }
  ],
